A$AP Rocky Says Rihanna &#8216;Changed a Lot&#8217; After Becoming a Mom, But &#8216;This Woman Has Always Been&nbsp;Magic&#8217;

Rihanna Shares Adorable Up-Close Look at Mom Life With Daughter Rocki: &#8216;Who&#8217;s the High-Fashion&nbsp;Baby?&#8217;

Billie Eilish Needs a New Rihanna Album in Her Life: &#8216;If She Ever F&#8212;ing Makes R9&#8230;&#8217;

In a TikTok posted by Vogue on Tuesday (April 28) &#8212; the same day the rapper and actress joined several other stars on the Chanel cruise in Biarritz, France &#8212; Rocky kicked things off by sharing what he&#8217;d want to do if he could trade lives with Kidman. &#8220;I would definitely steal whatever the hell is in her closet, &#8217;cause I know she&#8217;s got some s&#8211;t,&#8221; he said.

The Babygirl star&#8217;s answer was even more straightforward. &#8220;I&#8217;d get to kiss your wife,&#8221; she said, making Rocky burst into laughter. &#8220;Done.&#8221;

&#8220;Yo! You got it,&#8221; the hip-hop star cheered. &#8220;Nothing tops that. That was fire.&#8221;

Rocky and Ri have been a couple since sometime around the coronavirus pandemic, and share three young kids together: sons RZA and Riot and daughter Rocki. At just a few months old, the little girl recently made her magazine cover debut alongside the Fenty mogul for W , after which Ri shared an adorable behind-the-scenes video of herself and her &#8220;high-fashion baby&#8221; at the shoot.

In that issue, Rocky also explained how his partner has changed &#8212; and how she hasn&#8217;t &#8212; over the course of their relationship. &#8220;She became a mother in that time span, and that certainly changes you,&#8221; he told the publication. &#8220;But this woman has always been magic. Philosophically, the way she operates is on another level. She is the most charming and genuine person on Earth. Her energy is unmatched — one of a kind. I just adore her.&#8221;

